Common Voice (common_voice_19_0)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The `common_voice_19_0` reference transcripts are released under CC0 (public
domain dedication) and carry no attribution requirement.

Provenance / re-hosting note: the Common Voice reference text committed here was
obtained via the `flozi00/asr-german-mixed-evals` aggregator, not by accepting
Mozilla's click-through terms on the Common Voice site directly. CC0 waives
copyright, so redistributing the reference *text* is legally unencumbered.
Mozilla additionally *requests* that the Common Voice dataset not be re-hosted
or mirrored. We keep these committed references for zero-setup Tier-1 re-scoring;
if this ever becomes an issue we will switch to committing only a reference
hash/id and regenerating the text from source at re-score time (the escape hatch
below), rather than continuing to redistribute it.

