  7ca2492143b6d418ca42d6407f939ce8d2c53f66999e05906931ccefe6ff3148, verified
  2026-09-01):

      Name:        All Swiss German Dialects Test Set
      Description: Swiss German test set with a dialect distribution close to
                   the real distribution in Switzerland
      Version:     v1
      License:     MIT

  The archive states the licence by name and carries no copyright line of its
  own; the corpus is published by FHNW i4ds (Fachhochschule Nordwestschweiz,
  Institute for Data Science), to whom copyright is attributed here.
  Citation:
    Plüss et al., "Swiss German Speech to Standard German Text", SwissText 2021
    shared task 3 (FHNW i4ds).
  Source:
    https://www.dropbox.com/s/rfmjqkdjox7xstq/clickworker_collection_1.zip?dl=1
